==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Ghost Doge]]s spawn, delay 6.67~20 seconds<sup>200f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Ghost Snache]]s spawn, delay 10~30 seconds<sup>300f~900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Ghost Baa Baa]]s spawn, delay 13.33~40 seconds<sup>400f~1,200f</sup>.
*3 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Lord Enma]] spawns as the boss.
**12 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**6 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**1 [[Gory Groom]] spawns.

